&lt;p&gt;Let’s get this out of the way — what is “gravy blood”, and who is “Damp”?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This whole project started as an inside joke. My buddy and I would say we had gravy blood whenever we overindulged in a meal. That sluggish, heavy feeling afterward? In our lore, that’s the gravy blood kicking in.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Realtime BART Arrival Display</title><link>http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/</link><pubDate>Sun, 09 Nov 2025 08:03:55 -0700</pubDate><guid>http://localhost:1313/real-time-bart-display/</guid><description>&lt;figure class="responsive-image"&gt;
